{"id":168,"flavor":[{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It spews threads from its mouth to catch its prey. When night falls, it leaves its web to go hunt aggressively."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Every night, it wanders around in search of prey, whose movements it restrains by spewing threads before it bites into them with its fangs."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It spins thread from both its rear and its mouth. Then it wraps its prey up in thread and sips their bodily fluids at its leisure."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"There are some areas where people use the string Ariados spins for their own weaving. The resulting cloth is popular for its strength."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Ariados’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This Pokémon constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends."},{"games":["X","HeartGold"],"text":"It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It’s hard to tell which end is which."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"A single strand of a special string is endlessly spun out of its rear. The string leads back to its nest."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It is hard to tell which end is which."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. It constricts its foe with thin and strong silk webbing."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Rather than making a nest in one specific spot, it wanders in search of food after darkness falls."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Swarm","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Bug-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Sniper","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon's attack lands a critical hit, the attack is powered up even further."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Red","shape":"Armor","evolution":{"id":167,"name":"Spinarak","condition":null,"children":[{"id":168,"name":"Ariados","condition":"Lv. 22","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,14],[1,40],[1,71],[1,81],[1,116],[1,450],[1,565],[8,611],[12,184],[15,101],[19,425],[23,154],[28,389],[31,97],[35,42],[41,94],[46,398],[50,440],[54,564],[59,672]],"machine":[491,97,226,450,405,91,527,203,263,492,202,416,506,63,282,141,679,101,398,884,182,94,156,184,806,214,188,482,684,76,180,522,164,241,14,851,168,675,92,390,885,474,404],"egg":[50,679,224,400,476],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me3-2","name":"Ariados","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Common","number":"2","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-2/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-2/large"},{"id":"sv6-5","name":"Ariados","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"5","artist":"Anesaki Dynamic","img":"sv6/5"},{"id":"swsh12-4","name":"Ariados","set":"Silver Tempest","date":"2022-11-11","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"4","artist":"Tika Matsuno","img":"swsh12/4"},{"id":"swsh11-113","name":"Ariados","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare","number":"113","artist":"Shinji Kanda","img":"swsh11/113"},{"id":"pgo-7","name":"Ariados","set":"Pokémon GO","date":"2022-07-01","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"7","artist":"Misa Tsutsui","img":"pgo/7"},{"id":"swsh9tg-TG09","name":"Ariados","set":"Brilliant Stars Trainer Gallery","date":"2022-02-25","rarity":"Trainer Gallery Rare Holo","number":"TG09","artist":"Shiburingaru","img":"swsh9tg/TG09"},{"id":"swsh3-103","name":"Ariados","set":"Darkn